// TVI-WO-1308 adversarial pass: a PWR guard on a machine with no RCC guard (the stock board, the stock rcc). Its VOS-lowering rule
// (TVI-PWR-VOS, p310) needs the running clocks, which only the RCC guard computes: a lowering refuses, unmodeled.
using "platforms/boards/nucleo_h753zi.repl"
using "./stm32h7-pwr-restate.repl"

tviburiPwr:
    mode: "enforcing"
    revision: "V"
